    {
      "id": "glutes/lunge-with-jump",
      "slug": "lunge-with-jump",
      "name": "弓步跳",
      "muscle": "glutes",
      "bodyPart": "legs",
      "equipment": "bodyweight",
      "category": "plyometrics",
      "secondaryMuscles": [
        "hamstrings",
        "calves"
      ],
      "instructions": [
        "以正确的身体排列就位——耳朵在肩膀上方，肩膀在髋部上方。",
        "双脚与髋同宽站立（火车轨道，不是走钢丝）。迈步就位，躯干像旗杆一样挺直。",
        "后膝像电梯一样直直下降——不要向前冲。两膝都瞄准90度。保持前胫骨垂直。",
        "通过前脚跟发力站回来。想象通过前脚将地面推开。",
        "呼吸：跳跃或爆发性发力时用力呼气。在蓄力阶段吸气。"
      ],
      "file": "glutes/lunge-with-jump.gif",
      "gifUrl": "https://jahelcuadrado.github.io/ExerciseGymGigsDB/glutes/lunge-with-jump.gif",
      "thumbUrl": "https://jahelcuadrado.github.io/ExerciseGymGigsDB/glutes/lunge-with-jump.thumb.webp"
    },
    {
      "id": "pectorals/incline-push-up-depth-jump",
      "slug": "incline-push-up-depth-jump",
      "name": "上斜俯卧撑深度跳",
      "muscle": "pectorals",
      "bodyPart": "chest",
      "equipment": "bodyweight",
      "category": "plyometrics",
      "secondaryMuscles": [
        "triceps",
        "delts"
      ],
      "instructions": [
        "以正确的身体排列就位——耳朵在肩膀上方，肩膀在髋部上方。",
        "将凳子调整到指定的倾斜角度，背部紧贴靠垫。",
        "双手放在略宽于肩的位置。身体从头到脚跟成一条直线——将双手拧入地面产生张力。",
        "肘部呈45度弯曲降低身体，直到胸部几乎触地。主动将自己拉下来。",
        "将地面推离你回到顶部。锁定时收紧胸部，整个动作保持核心紧绷。",
        "呼吸：跳跃或爆发性发力时用力呼气。在蓄力阶段吸气。"
      ],
      "file": "pectorals/incline-push-up-depth-jump.gif",
      "gifUrl": "https://jahelcuadrado.github.io/ExerciseGymGigsDB/pectorals/incline-push-up-depth-jump.gif",
      "thumbUrl": "https://jahelcuadrado.github.io/ExerciseGymGigsDB/pectorals/incline-push-up-depth-jump.thumb.webp"
    },
